{"id": null, "n": "0221001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221001", "type": "orig", "text": "搆＝稱【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0221002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221002", "type": "orig", "text": "〔齊破…以自體〕二百四十字－【甲】"}
